{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/1792","id":25310541,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNTMxMDU0MQ==","number":1792,"title":"Use hasOwnProperty throughout the code","user":{"login":"DHainzl","id":5126798,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjY3OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5126798?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl","html_url":"https://github.com/DHainzl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DHainzl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2014-01-09T11:02:42Z","updated_at":"2014-01-10T20:39:14Z","closed_at":"2014-01-10T20:14:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi there,\n\nI just upgraded less from 1.4.1 to 1.6.0 and it did not work immediately. In my environment, the Array.prototype was extended with a \"unique\" function, which resulted in a lot of error messages, for example in those two lines (in the compiled less-1.6.0.js):\n\n```\n:1956 name[k].charAt is not a function -> name[\"unique\"] did not exists\n:4424 \"mixin\" is not defined -> source was loop in :4417 and then access to candidates[\"unique\"]\n```\n\nAdding \n\n```\nif (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(name, k)) { /* ... */ }\n```\n\nto all for ... in loops made it work for me.\n\nYours, David\n","closed_by":{"login":"lukeapage","id":309321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage","html_url":"https://github.com/lukeapage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1792/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}